# Raw and derived data — local only.
#
# Two rules make this ladder work and both are load-bearing:
#
# 1. `data/*`, not `data/`. Git does not descend into an excluded directory, so
#    a child of an excluded directory can never be re-included: under `data/`,
#    the `!data/processed/` line below would silently do nothing.
# 2. After re-including a directory you must re-exclude its CONTENTS on the next
#    line. `!data/raw/external/` makes git descend into that directory, and
#    without the `data/raw/external/*` that follows it, everything inside becomes
#    stageable. For this repo that means 523 private files totalling 1.5 GB: the
#    DeepPhase supplement zip, the non-redistributable PhosphoSitePlus database,
#    an AlphaFold database and the scraped web archive.
#
# The three `.../*` lines below therefore look redundant next to the negations
# and are not. Deleting any one of them re-creates that leak. Verify changes with
# `git add -An --dry-run .` — not `git check-ignore`, which misreports negated
# paths as ignored.
data/*
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/external/
data/raw/external/*
!data/raw/external/.gitkeep
!data/raw/external/_manifests/
data/raw/external/_manifests/*
!data/raw/external/_manifests/RAW_DATA_MANIFEST.md
!data/raw/external/_manifests/README.md
# Training tables derived from the paper supplementary datasets (E1).
!data/processed/

# But: src/phasepred/data/ ships model calibration constants (catgranule_v1_norm.json)
# and is part of the package, not user data.
!src/phasepred/data/
!src/phasepred/data/**

# Experiment artifact symlinks (heavy)
experiments/**/artifacts/*
!experiments/**/artifacts/.gitkeep

# S4 web-archive benchmark downloads/derived data (CATGRANULE_SPEC 4.2): big
# dumps live locally only; manifest.json is regenerated by the bootstrap script
data/raw/external/phasepred_web/

# Tool contract packages (docs/TOOL_LICENSES.md): each self-contained
# tools/<TOOL>/ dir ships run + manifest.toml + install.sh + README.md.
# Non-redistributable and/or large entities are user-installed locally and
# never enter git history.
tools/ESpritz/*.zip
tools/ESpritz/espritz/
tools/PScore/*.tgz
tools/PScore/SourceCodeS2/DBS/
tools/PLAAC/*.zip

# _archive: historical tools kept for experiment only (S3).
tools/_archive/catGRANULE_v2/catGRANULE2.0-1.0.0/
tools/_archive/catGRANULE_v2/*.tar.gz
tools/_archive/IUPred3/iupred3/
tools/_archive/IUPred3/*.tar.gz

# PLAAC: vendor LICENSE, README, cli/src/, build_*.sh, and the prebuilt
# plaac.jar under web/bin/; skip example datasets and web/public/.
tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/cli/example/
tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/web/*
!tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/web/bin/
tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/web/bin/*
!tools/PLAAC/plaac-master/web/bin/plaac.jar

# Object files from local builds
tools/SEG/*.o
tools/SEG/seg.sgi.iris5
tools/SEG/seg.sun.sunos4

# Legacy three-way layout (per-tool/wrappers/install) is gone since S3; keep
# it ignored so the folders never silently come back.
tools/per-tool/
tools/wrappers/
tools/install/

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
